From c2e6227580053becc5d50384a887c743c4d8d59b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bjoern Bachmann <bjoern.bachmann@emerson.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Dec 2025 11:56:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] sulfur implementation adaptions after chromium-ec main
 rebase.

- Fix the permanent active POWER_LED despite powered-off ARM AP.
  Fix wrong merge of task.c.
- I2C communication with ARM AP didn't work. TMP431 used wrong addr,
  got 0K as readback val.
- I2C Ports use the correct define CONFIG_HOSTCMD_I2C_ADDR_FLAGS.
- Fix eeinfo bug because of the wrong i2c addr. Use correct timer sleep
  function. Added missing code to power. Move defines to the correct place
  in fan.

Signed-off-by: Bjoern Bachmann <bjoern.bachmann@emerson.com>
